{"title":"Red Cactus","slug":"Red_Cactus","hero":{"file":"RedCactusTre.webp","width":400,"height":400},"pageid":1631,"revid":14971,"timestamp":"2024-10-05T13:45:10Z","lastEditor":"Boppy16","categories":["Trees"],"infobox":{"type":"Wood","fields":[{"label":"Island","value":"Ferwater"},{"label":"Hardness","value":"?"},{"label":"Log","value":"$3/stud"},{"label":"Sanded","value":"$29/stud"},{"label":"Planked","value":"$36.25/stud"},{"label":"Version Added","value":"1.37.0"},{"label":"Date Added","value":"08/23/23"},{"label":"Status","value":"Obtainable"}]},"sections":[{"id":"description","text":"Description"},{"id":"gallery","text":"Gallery"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>Red Cactus is a tree-type material found on top of the sandstone pillars in the Desert. Its appearance is a wider (near width of full-grown redwood) red-colored cactus. Sanded wood is a whiteish-purple with no texture.\n</p><p>To obtain Red Cactus, you need to either climb the sand pillars or travel into the mountainous area of the Desert.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"gallery\">Gallery</h2>\n<p>Mutated Red Cactus found in the image to the right. \n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wierd red cactus\">Wierd red cactus</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wierd red cactus\">Wierd red cactus</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>"}
